<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Purslip — Personal Financial Command Center</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Track your spending, manage your budgets, monitor your savings and understand your entire financial picture — all in one place."
    />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Purslip — Personal Financial Command Center" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Track your spending, manage your budgets, monitor your savings and understand your entire financial picture — all in one place."
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="/images/icon-512.png" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32" type="image/png" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" />
    <link rel="preload" as="image" href="/purslip-frames/frame_0000.webp?v=city153" type="image/webp" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/purslip-landing.css?v=city153-v3" />
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; background-color: #050403;">
    <div class="ps-landing" id="purslip-landing">
      <!-- ====================================================================
           FIXED SCROLL-CONTROLLED 3D IMAGE-SEQUENCE CANVAS
           Independently replaceable 300-500 frame sequence stage
           ==================================================================== -->
      <div class="ps-canvas-stage" aria-hidden="true" data-scroll-sequence-stage>
        <canvas
          id="purslip-scroll-canvas"
          class="ps-scroll-canvas"
          data-testid="purslip-scroll-canvas"
        ></canvas>
        <div class="ps-canvas-vignette"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- ====================================================================
           A. FLOATING NAVIGATION BAR
           ==================================================================== -->
      <div class="ps-nav-wrapper">
        <header class="ps-nav" id="purslip-nav" data-scrolled="false">
          <a href="#top" class="ps-brand" aria-label="Purslip Home">
            <%- include('partials/logo-mark') %>
            <span>Purslip</span>
          </a>

          <nav class="ps-nav-links" aria-label="Primary Navigation">
            <a href="#features" class="ps-nav-link">Features</a>
            <a href="#how-it-works" class="ps-nav-link">How it works</a>
            <a href="#benefits" class="ps-nav-link">Benefits</a>
            <a href="#faq" class="ps-nav-link">FAQ</a>
          </nav>

          <div class="ps-nav-actions">
            <% if (locals.currentUser) { %>
              <a href="/dashboard" data-route="dashboard" class="ps-btn-primary">Dashboard</a>
            <% } else { %>
              <a href="/auth/login" data-route="login" class="ps-nav-login">Log in</a>
              <a href="/auth/signup" data-route="register" class="ps-btn-primary">Get started</a>
            <% } %>
          </div>

          <button
            type="button"
            class="ps-mobile-toggle"
            id="ps-mobile-menu-btn"
            aria-label="Toggle navigation menu"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="ps-mobile-drawer"
          >
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <line x1="4" y1="7" x2="20" y2="7" />
              <line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12" />
              <line x1="4" y1="17" x2="20" y2="17" />
            </svg>
          </button>
        </header>

        <div class="ps-mobile-drawer" id="ps-mobile-drawer" data-open="false">
          <nav class="ps-mobile-drawer-links" aria-label="Mobile Navigation">
            <a href="#features" class="ps-nav-link">Features</a>
            <a href="#how-it-works" class="ps-nav-link">How it works</a>
            <a href="#benefits" class="ps-nav-link">Benefits</a>
            <a href="#faq" class="ps-nav-link">FAQ</a>
          </nav>
          <div class="ps-mobile-drawer-actions">
            <% if (locals.currentUser) { %>
              <a href="/dashboard" data-route="dashboard" class="ps-btn-primary">Dashboard</a>
            <% } else { %>
              <a href="/auth/login" data-route="login" class="ps-nav-login">Log in</a>
              <a href="/auth/signup" data-route="register" class="ps-btn-primary">Get started</a>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ====================================================================
           MAIN FOREGROUND CONTENT
           ==================================================================== -->
      <main class="ps-page-content" id="top">
        <!-- ==================================================================
             B. HERO SECTION
             ================================================================== -->
        <section class="ps-hero" aria-labelledby="ps-hero-heading">
          <div class="ps-container">
            <div class="ps-hero-grid">
              <div class="ps-hero-copy">
                <p class="ps-descriptor">
                  <span>Your personal financial command center.</span>
                  <span class="ps-descriptor-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>Multi-Currency &amp; Bilingual</span>
                </p>

                <h1 class="ps-hero-title" id="ps-hero-heading">
                  Your money deserves a <em>clearer picture.</em>
                </h1>

                <p class="ps-hero-subtitle">
                  Track your spending, manage your budgets, monitor your savings and understand
                  your entire financial picture — all in one place.
                </p>

                <div class="ps-hero-ctas">
                  <a href="/auth/signup" data-route="register" class="ps-btn-primary ps-btn-lg">
                    Get Started
                  </a>
                  <a href="#showcase" class="ps-btn-secondary ps-btn-lg">
                    Explore Purslip
                  </a>
                </div>

                <div class="ps-hero-meta">
                  <span><strong>8 Core Modules</strong></span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>Accounts, Budgets, Goals &amp; Lending</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>CSV Import</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>English &amp; اردو</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Right-hand Architectural Telemetry Card over the 3D Stage -->
              <aside class="ps-hero-stage-card" aria-label="Consolidated Household Position">
                <div class="ps-stage-card-header">
                  <span class="ps-stage-card-title">Consolidated Net Worth</span>
                  <span class="ps-stage-card-currency">PKR · Primary Ledger</span>
                </div>

                <div class="ps-stage-networth">
                  <div class="ps-stage-networth-label">Total Verified Position</div>
                  <div class="ps-stage-networth-value ps-tabular">PKR 4,820,500</div>
                  <div class="ps-stage-networth-delta ps-tabular">
                    <span>+PKR 186,550 net monthly surplus</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="ps-stage-accounts">
                  <div class="ps-stage-account-row">
                    <span class="ps-stage-account-name">Meezan Bank Current</span>
                    <span class="ps-stage-account-val ps-tabular">PKR 802,000</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-stage-account-row">
                    <span class="ps-stage-account-name">HBL Freedom Account</span>
                    <span class="ps-stage-account-val ps-tabular">PKR 401,200</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-stage-account-row">
                    <span class="ps-stage-account-name">National Savings &amp; Goal Pots</span>
                    <span class="ps-stage-account-val ps-tabular">PKR 3,150,300</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-stage-account-row">
                    <span class="ps-stage-account-name">SadaPay &amp; Net Receivables</span>
                    <span class="ps-stage-account-val ps-tabular">PKR 467,000</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </aside>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ==================================================================
             C. REALISTIC PRODUCT SHOWCASE
             ================================================================== -->
        <section class="ps-section" id="showcase" aria-labelledby="ps-showcase-heading">
          <div class="ps-container">
            <div class="ps-section-header-split">
              <div>
                <p class="ps-kicker">Interactive Product Walkthrough</p>
                <h2 class="ps-section-title" id="ps-showcase-heading">
                  Built for real household ledgers, <em>not decorative charts.</em>
                </h2>
                <p class="ps-section-desc">
                  Explore how Purslip organizes balances, monthly budgets, CSV statement imports,
                  and personal lending records across currencies, languages, and themes.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Interactive Workspace Controls -->
            <div class="ps-showcase-toolbar">
              <div class="ps-segmented-group" role="tablist" aria-label="Purslip Workspace Views">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  role="tab"
                  class="ps-seg-btn"
                  data-dash-view="overview"
                  aria-selected="true"
                >
                  Overview
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  role="tab"
                  class="ps-seg-btn"
                  data-dash-view="transactions"
                  aria-selected="false"
                >
                  Transactions &amp; CSV
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  role="tab"
                  class="ps-seg-btn"
                  data-dash-view="budgets"
                  aria-selected="false"
                >
                  Budgets &amp; Goals
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  role="tab"
                  class="ps-seg-btn"
                  data-dash-view="lending"
                  aria-selected="false"
                >
                  Lent &amp; Borrowed
                </button>
              </div>

              <div class="ps-showcase-controls-right">
                <div class="ps-segmented-group" aria-label="Preview Currency">
                  <button type="button" class="ps-seg-btn" data-dash-currency="PKR" aria-pressed="true">
                    PKR
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="ps-seg-btn" data-dash-currency="USD" aria-pressed="false">
                    USD
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="ps-seg-btn" data-dash-currency="GBP" aria-pressed="false">
                    GBP
                  </button>
                </div>

                <div class="ps-segmented-group" aria-label="Preview Language">
                  <button type="button" class="ps-seg-btn" data-dash-lang="en" aria-pressed="true">
                    English
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="ps-seg-btn" data-dash-lang="ur" aria-pressed="false">
                    اردو
                  </button>
                </div>

                <div class="ps-segmented-group" aria-label="Preview Theme">
                  <button type="button" class="ps-seg-btn" data-dash-theme="dark" aria-pressed="true">
                    Dark
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="ps-seg-btn" data-dash-theme="night" aria-pressed="false">
                    Night
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="ps-seg-btn" data-dash-theme="light" aria-pressed="false">
                    Light
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Realistic Purslip Application Window -->
            <div
              class="ps-dashboard-frame"
              id="ps-dashboard-frame"
              data-preview-theme="dark"
              data-preview-currency="PKR"
              data-preview-lang="en"
            >
              <div class="ps-dash-topbar">
                <div class="ps-dash-workspace">
                  <span id="ps-dash-view-title">Consolidated Financial Command</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span class="ps-dash-period">November 2026</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-dash-account-pills">
                  <span>Meezan Current</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>HBL Freedom</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>SadaPay</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                  <span>National Savings</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 4 Core Financial Metrics -->
              <div class="ps-dash-kpi-strip" id="ps-dash-kpi-strip">
                <!-- Populated deterministically by purslip-landing.js -->
              </div>

              <!-- Middle Row: Cash Flow SVG Chart + Monthly Budget Progress -->
              <div class="ps-dash-body">
                <div class="ps-dash-panel ps-dash-panel-left">
                  <div class="ps-panel-header">
                    <h3 class="ps-panel-heading" id="ps-dash-chart-heading">
                      Six-Month Cash Flow (Income vs. Expenses)
                    </h3>
                    <div class="ps-panel-legend">
                      <span>
                        <span class="ps-legend-swatch" style="background: #3D9A6B;"></span>Inflow
                      </span>
                      <span>
                        <span class="ps-legend-swatch" style="background: #C58F71;"></span>Outflow
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-chart-svg-wrap">
                    <svg
                      id="ps-dash-chart-svg"
                      class="ps-chart-svg"
                      viewBox="0 0 640 200"
                      preserveAspectRatio="none"
                      role="img"
                      aria-label="Six-month financial cash flow chart"
                    ></svg>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="ps-dash-panel">
                  <div class="ps-panel-header">
                    <h3 class="ps-panel-heading">Monthly Budgets &amp; Limits</h3>
                    <span class="ps-tx-meta">Nov 2026</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-budget-list" id="ps-dash-budget-list">
                    <!-- Populated deterministically by purslip-landing.js -->
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Bottom Row: Recent Transactions + Category / Account Breakdown -->
              <div class="ps-dash-bottom">
                <div class="ps-dash-panel ps-dash-panel-left">
                  <div class="ps-panel-header">
                    <h3 class="ps-panel-heading">Recent Ledger Activity</h3>
                    <span class="ps-tx-meta">Verified Entries &amp; CSV Imports</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-tx-table" id="ps-dash-tx-list">
                    <!-- Populated deterministically by purslip-landing.js -->
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="ps-dash-panel">
                  <div class="ps-panel-header">
                    <h3 class="ps-panel-heading">Distribution Breakdown</h3>
                    <span class="ps-tx-meta">Share of Total</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-breakdown-list" id="ps-dash-breakdown-list">
                    <!-- Populated deterministically by purslip-landing.js -->
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ==================================================================
             D. FINANCIAL FEATURES (8 CAPABILITIES IN VARIED EDITORIAL LAYOUT)
             ================================================================== -->
        <section class="ps-section ps-section-alt" id="features" aria-labelledby="ps-features-heading">
          <div class="ps-container">
            <div class="ps-section-header">
              <p class="ps-kicker">Eight Integrated Capabilities</p>
              <h2 class="ps-section-title" id="ps-features-heading">
                Every dimension of your personal finances, <em>structured with clarity.</em>
              </h2>
              <p class="ps-section-desc">
                From daily grocery receipts and CSV bank statements to multi-currency accounts and
                personal lending records, Purslip keeps your financial life organized in one place.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Editorial Row 1: Asymmetric 7:5 Split (Features 01 & 02) -->
            <div class="ps-editorial-row-1">
              <!-- 01. Complete Financial Overview -->
              <article class="ps-feature-block">
                <div>
                  <span class="ps-feature-index">01. Complete Financial Overview</span>
                  <h3 class="ps-feature-title">Know your exact net worth and liquid balance at a glance</h3>
                  <p class="ps-feature-copy">
                    Bring together current accounts, savings certificates, digital wallets, and cash
                    in hand across multiple currencies so you always see your true net position.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-demo-surface">
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Total Liquid &amp; Savings Assets</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular" style="color: var(--ps-ivory);">PKR 4,635,500</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Net Lending Receivables (Lent - Borrowed)</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular" style="color: var(--ps-positive);">+PKR 185,000</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span><strong>Consolidated Net Worth</strong></span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular" style="color: var(--ps-copper); font-weight: 600;">
                      PKR 4,820,500
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <!-- 02. Smart Transaction Management -->
              <article class="ps-feature-block">
                <div>
                  <span class="ps-feature-index">02. Smart Transaction Management</span>
                  <h3 class="ps-feature-title">Log daily activity or import bank CSV statements in seconds</h3>
                  <p class="ps-feature-copy">
                    Record income and expenses with clean categories, search historical entries
                    instantly, or upload monthly CSV statements without manual re-entry.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-demo-surface">
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Meezan_Statement_Nov.csv</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular" style="color: var(--ps-positive);">48 Rows Imported</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Category Rules Applied</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular">Utilities · Groceries · Payroll</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Duplicate Entry Detection</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular">0 Collisions</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>

            <!-- Editorial Row 2: 3-Column Architectural Ledger Strip (Features 03, 04, 05) -->
            <div class="ps-editorial-row-2">
              <!-- 03. Monthly Budgets and Spending Limits -->
              <article class="ps-editorial-col-cell">
                <div>
                  <span class="ps-feature-index">03. Monthly Budgets &amp; Limits</span>
                  <h3 class="ps-feature-title">Set realistic category ceilings</h3>
                  <p class="ps-feature-copy">
                    Define monthly spending limits for groceries, utilities, fuel, and dining, and
                    see how much room remains before the month closes.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-demo-surface">
                  <div class="ps-budget-row" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <span>Household &amp; Utilities</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular">80% used</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-progress-track">
                    <div class="ps-progress-fill" style="width: 80%;"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <!-- 04. Savings Goals -->
              <article class="ps-editorial-col-cell">
                <div>
                  <span class="ps-feature-index">04. Savings Goals</span>
                  <h3 class="ps-feature-title">Fund specific milestones deliberately</h3>
                  <p class="ps-feature-copy">
                    Create dedicated targets for emergency reserves, household upgrades, or annual
                    obligations and track every contribution toward completion.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-demo-surface">
                  <div class="ps-budget-row" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <span>Emergency Fund (PKR 1.08M / 1.2M)</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular" style="color: var(--ps-positive);">90%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-progress-track">
                    <div class="ps-progress-fill" data-status="healthy" style="width: 90%;"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <!-- 05. Cash Flow and Spending Analytics -->
              <article class="ps-editorial-col-cell">
                <div>
                  <span class="ps-feature-index">05. Cash Flow &amp; Analytics</span>
                  <h3 class="ps-feature-title">Measure your net monthly surplus</h3>
                  <p class="ps-feature-copy">
                    Compare total inflows against outflows across months and inspect detailed
                    spending reports to uncover where your money actually goes.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-demo-surface">
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Nov Inflow vs. Outflow</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular" style="color: var(--ps-positive);">+40.1% Surplus</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Net Retained Cash</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular">PKR 186,550</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>

            <!-- Editorial Row 3: 3 Detailed Operational Blocks (Features 06, 07, 08) -->
            <div class="ps-editorial-row-3">
              <!-- 06. Accounts and Transfers -->
              <article class="ps-feature-block">
                <div>
                  <span class="ps-feature-index">06. Accounts &amp; Transfers</span>
                  <h3 class="ps-feature-title">Move money between accounts without distorting expenses</h3>
                  <p class="ps-feature-copy">
                    Record transfers between bank accounts, wallets, and cash balances cleanly so
                    internal movements never inflate your spending reports.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-demo-surface">
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Meezan Current &rarr; National Savings</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular">PKR 150,000</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>SadaPay USD &rarr; HBL PKR</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular">$287.00 &rarr; PKR 80,000</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <!-- 07. Recurring Bills -->
              <article class="ps-feature-block">
                <div>
                  <span class="ps-feature-index">07. Recurring Bills &amp; Payments</span>
                  <h3 class="ps-feature-title">Stay ahead of fixed monthly obligations</h3>
                  <p class="ps-feature-copy">
                    Keep rent, electricity, fiber internet, school fees, and subscriptions organized
                    on a clear schedule so no payment catches you off guard.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-demo-surface">
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>House Rent · Due 01 Dec</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular">PKR 55,000</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Nayatel Fiber · Due 03 Dec</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular">PKR 6,850</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <!-- 08. Lending and Borrowing Management -->
              <article class="ps-feature-block">
                <div>
                  <span class="ps-feature-index">08. Money Lent &amp; Borrowed</span>
                  <h3 class="ps-feature-title">Track personal loans and family repayments with respect</h3>
                  <p class="ps-feature-copy">
                    Maintain a clear record of money lent to friends or borrowed for milestones,
                    complete with partial settlements and due dates.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="ps-demo-surface">
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Bilal Ahmed (Receivable)</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular" style="color: var(--ps-positive);">+PKR 140,000</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ps-demo-row">
                    <span>Family Car Installment (Payable)</span>
                    <span class="ps-tabular" style="color: var(--ps-copper);">-PKR 60,000</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ==================================================================
             E. HOW IT WORKS (3 HONEST STEPS)
             ================================================================== -->
        <section class="ps-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="ps-how-heading">
          <div class="ps-container">
            <div class="ps-section-header">
              <p class="ps-kicker">How Purslip Works</p>
              <h2 class="ps-section-title" id="ps-how-heading">
                Three deliberate steps to <em>complete financial order.</em>
              </h2>
              <p class="ps-section-desc">
                You stay in full control of your records—no third-party bank credentials required.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="ps-steps-grid">
              <article class="ps-step-card">
                <span class="ps-step-num">01 — Connect and organize your accounts.</span>
                <h3 class="ps-step-heading">Set up your bank accounts, wallets, and savings</h3>
                <p class="ps-step-text">
                  Add your checking accounts, digital wallets, cash balances, and savings pots in
                  PKR or foreign currencies, or import existing transaction history directly via CSV
                  files.
                </p>
                <p class="ps-step-detail">
                  Supports multiple accounts · Multi-currency · CSV statement import
                </p>
              </article>

              <article class="ps-step-card">
                <span class="ps-step-num">02 — Track income, expenses and financial activity.</span>
                <h3 class="ps-step-heading">Log transactions, transfers, bills, and lending</h3>
                <p class="ps-step-text">
                  Categorize inflows and outflows, record internal account transfers, schedule
                  recurring monthly bills, and keep accurate records of money lent or borrowed.
                </p>
                <p class="ps-step-detail">
                  Income &amp; expenses · Account transfers · Recurring bills · Lending ledger
                </p>
              </article>

              <article class="ps-step-card">
                <span class="ps-step-num">03 — Understand your spending and make better decisions.</span>
                <h3 class="ps-step-heading">Review cash flow, budget progress, and net worth</h3>
                <p class="ps-step-text">
                  Analyze monthly spending reports, monitor category limits, track savings goal
